        "path": "tooling/workspace/index.md",
        "title": "workspace",
        "content": "# Workspace Tooling\n\nThese documents cover optional tools that can be installed inside a Polaris\nworkspace.\n\n- [nvim.md](./nvim.md)\n- [tmux.md](./tmux.md)\n- [zsh.md](./zsh.md)\n"
