    "unified": "diff --git a/0.2.3/index.md b/0.2.4/index.md\nindex 72e6b19..e18ae69 100644\n--- a/0.2.3/index.md\n+++ b/0.2.4/index.md\n@@ -1,17 +1,19 @@\n-# Docs 0.2.3\n+# Docs 0.2.4\n \n-This directory is the frozen documentation snapshot for version `0.2.3`.\n+This directory is the frozen documentation snapshot for version `0.2.4`.\n \n-It captures the first release that treats docs as versioned product artifacts,\n-ships a docs viewer app, and keeps `latest` as a separately maintained track.\n+It captures the reorganized Polaris documentation structure with customer-first\n+entry points and sectioned product flows.\n \n ## Included Areas\n \n - `polaris/index.md`\n-- [polaris/isolation-maturity.md](./polaris/isolation-maturity.md)\n-- [polaris/agent-swarm-maturity.md](./polaris/agent-swarm-maturity.md)\n-- [polaris/evolution-maturity.md](./polaris/evolution-maturity.md)\n-- [polaris/user-management-maturity.md](./polaris/user-management-maturity.md)\n+- `polaris/what-your-team-gets.md`\n+- `polaris/onboarding/`\n+- `polaris/governed-use/`\n+- `polaris/shared-infrastructure/`\n+- `polaris/member-exit-and-handover/`\n+- `polaris/agent-swarm-maturity.md`\n - [operations/remote-deploy.md](./operations/remote-deploy.md)\n - [operations/setup-k3s-across-multiple-machines.md](./operations/setup-k3s-across-multiple-machines.md)\n - `tooling/workspace/index.md`\n@@ -20,5 +22,5 @@ ships a docs viewer app, and keeps `latest` as a separately maintained track.\n ## Snapshot Notes\n \n - This snapshot is intentionally immutable.\n-- It preserves the release wording for `0.2.3`.\n+- It preserves the release wording for `0.2.4`.\n - Future docs-only changes should go into `latest`."
