    "unified": "diff --git a/0.2.3/polaris/member-exit-and-handover/index.md b/0.2.4/polaris/member-exit-and-handover/index.md\nindex e69de29..36742ec 100644\n--- a/0.2.3/polaris/member-exit-and-handover/index.md\n+++ b/0.2.4/polaris/member-exit-and-handover/index.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,15 @@\n+# Member Exit And Handover\n+\n+This section explains how Polaris separates personal experience from\n+team-owned project context when a member leaves.\n+\n+It focuses on:\n+\n+- person-specific working patterns\n+- project and environment knowledge that must stay with the team\n+- session snapshots and handover context\n+\n+Detailed docs:\n+\n+- [personal-and-team-context.md](./personal-and-team-context.md)\n+- [others.md](./others.md)"
