    "unified": "diff --git a/0.2.4/CHANGELOG.md b/latest/CHANGELOG.md\nindex f5214dc..8b64064 100644\n--- a/0.2.4/CHANGELOG.md\n+++ b/latest/CHANGELOG.md\n@@ -1,22 +1,8 @@\n # Docs Changelog\n \n-## 0.2.4 vs 0.2.3\n+## latest vs 0.2.4\n \n-### Added\n+No unreleased documentation changes are tracked after `0.2.4` yet.\n \n-- Customer-facing Polaris sections for onboarding, governed use, shared\n-  infrastructure, and member exit and handover.\n-- Focused sub-documents for ownership, credential switching, shared Docker\n-  foundations, runtime state, and handover context.\n-\n-### Changed\n-\n-- Polaris documentation is now organized primarily around customer product\n-  flows instead of older top-level technical maturity pages.\n-- The earlier technical notes were merged into the new section docs and\n-  section-level `others` pages.\n-\n-### Notes\n-\n-- `0.2.4` is the current frozen release snapshot.\n-- `latest` starts from this baseline.\n+The next docs-only update should be recorded here before the following release\n+snapshot is frozen."
